## Findings addressed

1. [BLOCKING] Double-verify 409 surfaced to user
   - Fix: Added idempotency pre-check at top of verifyPayment() in
     subscriptions.service.ts — returns existing active subscription
     directly instead of delegating to createSubscription.

2. [BLOCKING] updateVerificationStatus skips subscription gate
   - Fix: Set isPublished: false unconditionally in hotels.service.ts
     updateVerificationStatus() — legacy admin-approve route no longer
     auto-publishes the hotel.

3. [SHOULD-FIX] ENTERPRISE plan goes straight to Paystack checkout
   - Fix: Updated confirm screen copy in subscription/page.tsx to say
     "You will be redirected to Paystack to complete your ₦150,000/month
     Enterprise plan payment securely." — truthful UI, no behavior change.

4. [SHOULD-FIX] Callback page fires verify on every mount
   - Fix: Added useRef(false) guard in CallbackInner — verifiedRef.current
     is set to true on first execution, subsequent mounts are no-ops.

5. [SHOULD-FIX] Publish guard partial bypass via subscriptionPlan column
   - Fix: publishHotel() now requires activeSub unconditionally, dropped
     the `!hotel.subscriptionPlan` shortcut.
